	<img height="283" src="img/zokabuto031_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/zokabuto/img/zokabuto031.jpg" --></a><a href="img/zokabuto032.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/zokabuto032_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/zokabuto/img/zokabuto032.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
